  "package_redundancy": "Each linear/nonlinear system has different coefficients or factor structure; repeated coordinate-swapping distractors do not repeat the same answer. q37 combines two numerical checks and their actual symmetry proof. q38 groups two source checks with extra alternatives; q41 compares complete sign/axis tables, not isolated cell clicks. Mathematical elimination can distinguish complete answers without independently writing every entry; this is not itself a failed fidelity gate.",
